#. module: hr_rfid_vending
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid_vending.field_hr_employee__hr_rfid_vending_balance
msgid ""
"Company-provided balance for vending machine purchases.\n"
"        \n"
"• Purpose: Budget allocated by employer for employee refreshments\n"
"• Usage: Automatically deducted when purchasing items from vending machines\n"
"• Refills: Can be topped up manually or automatically via monthly refill settings\n"
"• Limits: Combined with personal balance and daily limits for spending control\n"
"        \n"
"This balance represents company funds available to the employee for vending purchases."
msgstr "Сума пари, които служител може да похарчи на автомата"

#. module: hr_rfid_vending
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:hr_rfid_vending.field_hr_employee__hr_rfid_vending_balance_history
